      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.55">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">授权</span>：RTX 3090 约三天连续运行；仅对新建 v9 撤销 48 GPU-h 门，不回写 v6–v8</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">SimMark v9</span>：200 篇 fit + 1,800 篇 certificate 结构计算（约 29h11m）</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">SemStamp v10</span>：P0 health 前置，通过后才自动启动 1,799 篇 certificate</p>
      </content>
